{"type":"text","timestamp":1790380081287,"sessionID":"ses_f250d30c2ffevWu073yvu40SAQ","part":{"id":"prt_0daf8005b001hggIT7dlhLqI37","messageID":"msg_0daf68d84001f86g7I4ccb0f5v","sessionID":"ses_f250d30c2ffevWu073yvu40SAQ","type":"text","text":"The harness starts cleanly in Godot 4.4.1, and the captured frame shows all three cards in Base state. Next I’ll check the 55 ms release guard, target entry/exit, valid drops, and cancellation back to each original slot.","time":{"start":1790380081243,"end":1790380081247},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0a3f128532fd4686016ab7081e7de88196bec70a4c6d461625","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790380081287,"sessionID":"ses_f250d30c2ffevWu073yvu40SAQ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_jedyNk821jOCVlkdQ2TGuAx6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/.godot/verify_card_drag.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+var harness\n+var hand\n+var overlay\n+var mouse_position := Vector2.ZERO\n+var checks := 0\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\t_run.call_deferred()\n+\n+\n+func check(condition: bool, message: String) -> void:\n+\tif not condition:\n+\t\tpush_error(\"FAIL: \" + message)\n+\t\tquit(1)\n+\t\tassert(condition, message)\n+\tchecks += 1\n+\tprint(\"PASS: \", message)\n+\n+\n+func state_name(card) -> String:\n+\treturn card.card_state_machine.current_state.name\n+\n+\n+func motion(position: Vector2) -> void:\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseMotion.new()\n+\tevent.position = position\n+\tevent.global_position = position\n+\tevent.relative = position - mouse_position\n+\tmouse_position = position\n+\troot.push_input(event, true)\n+\n+\n+func button(index: MouseButton, pressed: bool) -> void:\n+\tvar event := InputEventMouseButton.new()\n+\tevent.position = mouse_position\n+\tevent.global_position = mouse_position\n+\tevent.button_index = index\n+\tevent.pressed = pressed\n+\troot.push_input(event, true)\n+\n+\n+func settle() -> void:\n+\tfor i in range(3):\n+\t\tawait physics_frame\n+\t\tawait process_frame\n+\n+\n+func capture(filename: String) -> void:\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/\" + filename + \".png\")\n+\n+\n+func begin_drag(card, destination: Vector2) -> void:\n+\tmotion(card.global_position + Vector2(12, 15))\n+\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardClickedState\", \"GUI click enters clicked state\")\n+\tcheck(card.original_index == card.get_index(), \"Clicked state records original index\")\n+\tcheck(card.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Clicked state enables target monitoring\")\n+\tmotion(destination)\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardDraggingState\", \"Mouse motion enters dragging state\")\n+\tcheck(card.get_parent() == overlay, \"Drag uses the alternate harness overlay group\")\n+\tcheck(card.global_position.is_equal_approx(destination - Vector2(12, 15)), \"Drag follows mouse with the grab offset\")\n+\n+\n+func _run() -> void:\n+\tharness = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(harness)\n+\tcurrent_scene = harness\n+\thand = harness.get_node(\"BattleOverlay/MoveBar\")\n+\toverlay = harness.get_node(\"BattleOverlay\")\n+\tawait settle()\n+\tvar cards := hand.get_children()\n+\tcheck(cards.size() == 3, \"Harness creates three cards in MoveBar\")\n+\tfor card in cards:\n+\t\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardBaseState\", \"Initial state entered for \" + card.card_title)\n+\t\tcheck(not card.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Initial monitoring disabled\")\n+\t\tfor state in card.card_state_machine.get_children():\n+\t\t\tcheck(state.card_ui == card, \"Child state initialized\")\n+\t\t\tcheck(state.transition_requested.is_connected(card.card_state_machine._on_transition_requested), \"Child transition signal connected\")\n+\t\tcard.get_node(\"CardStateMachine/CardDraggingState\").transition_requested.emit(card.get_node(\"CardStateMachine/CardDraggingState\"), 3)\n+\t\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardBaseState\", \"Inactive state transition ignored\")\n+\n+\t# Early release must leave the card dragging; cancellation must restore every slot.\n+\tfor index in range(cards.size()):\n+\t\tvar card = cards[index]\n+\t\tbegin_drag(card, Vector2(110, 50))\n+\t\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\t\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardDraggingState\", \"Release before 55ms is ignored\")\n+\t\tawait settle()\n+\t\tcheck(card.targets.has(harness.get_node(\"ConfirmArea\")), \"Physics overlap populates targets\")\n+\t\tcard._on_drop_point_detector_area_entered(harness.get_node(\"ConfirmArea\"))\n+\t\tcheck(card.targets.size() == 1, \"Duplicate area callback does not duplicate targets\")\n+\t\tif index == 1:\n+\t\t\tawait capture(\"card_drag_active\")\n+\t\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, true)\n+\t\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, false)\n+\t\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardBaseState\", \"Right-click cancels to base\")\n+\t\tcheck(card.get_parent() == hand and card.get_index() == index, \"Cancelled card returns to its original index\")\n+\t\tcheck(not card.drop_point_detector.monitoring and card.targets.is_empty(), \"Cancellation resets monitoring and targets\")\n+\t\tawait settle()\n+\t\tcheck(hand.get_children() == cards, \"Hand order is preserved\")\n+\tawait capture(\"card_drag_cancelled\")\n+\n+\tvar card = cards[1]\n+\tbegin_drag(card, Vector2(110, 50))\n+\tawait settle()\n+\tcheck(not card.targets.is_empty(), \"Target detected on a subsequent drag\")\n+\tmotion(Vector2(110, 135))\n+\tawait settle()\n+\tcheck(card.targets.is_empty(), \"Leaving the drop area removes targets\")\n+\tawait create_timer(0.07).timeout\n+\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardReleasedState\", \"Mature release enters released state\")\n+\tcheck(not card.is_queued_for_deletion(), \"Untargeted release keeps the card\")\n+\tawait settle()\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardReleasedState\", \"Untargeted release waits for the next input\")\n+\tmotion(Vector2(112, 135))\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardBaseState\" and card.get_parent() == hand, \"Next input restores an untargeted release\")\n+\tcheck(card.get_index() == 1, \"Untargeted release restores original index\")\n+\tawait settle()\n+\n+\tbegin_drag(card, Vector2(110, 50))\n+\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardDraggingState\", \"Minimum threshold resets on each drag\")\n+\tawait settle()\n+\tawait create_timer(0.07).timeout\n+\tbutton(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n+\tcheck(state_name(card) == \"CardReleasedState\", \"Click confirms a drag after an early release\")\n+